{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44733","headline":"题东兰若 · 灵一","name":"题东兰若","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上入禅室路裴回，万木清阴向日开。\n寒竹影侵行迳石，秋风声入诵经台。\n闲云不系从舒卷，狎鸟无机任往来。\n更惜片阳谈妙理，归时莫待暝钟催。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"灵一","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44733.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44733","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}